---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Agent Built
description: Notes from building real things with AI agents. Tools, integrations, and the workflows that actually ship.
---
<section class="hero">
  <h1 class="hero-title">Building with AI agents.</h1>
  <p class="hero-lede">Notes, comparisons, and the workflows that actually ship. From a working operator, not a thread guy.</p>
</section>

{% if collections.posts.length %}
<section class="posts">
  {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
  <article class="post-card">
    {% if post.data.hero %}
    <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="post-card-image">
      <img src="{{ post.data.hero }}" alt="{{ post.data.hero_alt or post.data.title }}" loading="lazy" width="800" height="450">
    </a>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="post-card-body">
      <div class="post-card-meta">
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
        {% if post.data.tags and post.data.tags.length %}
          <span class="sep">·</span>
          {% for t in post.data.tags %}<span class="tag">#{{ t }}</span>{% if not loop.last %} {% endif %}{% endfor %}
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <h2 class="post-card-title"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
      {% if post.data.description %}<p class="post-card-desc">{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
{% else %}
<p class="empty-state">First post coming shortly.</p>
{% endif %}
